# Feature modules

## Adding a feature

1. `domain/` — entity, repository port, `defineErrorCatalog` errors.
2. `application/schemas/` — Zod (single source for Action + API).
3. `application/use-cases/` — business logic; throw catalog errors; assume validated input.
4. `infrastructure/adapters/drizzle/` — `schema.ts`, repository with `toDomain`, factory.
5. `presentation/actions/` — `"use server"` + separate `types.ts` for client state.
6. Optional: `app/api/v1/<resource>/` — API key auth, same Zod + use cases.
7. Export public API via `index.ts` (server/barrel); clients import actions directly.

## Dual entry pattern

```
Server Action (session)  ─┐
                          ├─► use case ─► port ─► adapter
Route Handler (API key)  ─┘
```

## Tests

Mock `*.factory.ts` in unit tests; see `src/modules/users/application/use-cases/*.test.ts`.
